  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks. Cut carrot into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637ffd8cde439bda2f07e53b/step-6e391cf2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place potato and carrot on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.\n• Meanwhile, thinly slice haloumi. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637ffd8cde439bda2f07e53b/step-0a8da47f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 mins remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Remove pan from heat and add pesto, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637ffd8cde439bda2f07e53b/step-c99e7ffc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato. Add tomato, baby spinach and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil to the roast veggies. Season and toss.\n• Divide roast veggie medley between plates. Top with pesto haloumi. Drizzle with the dill & parsley mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637ffd8cde439bda2f07e53b/step-eb68ac35.jpg"
    }
  ]
